{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/698c95bee7c0569baff37d906f144c19.poster.avif?t=1772810197\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/698c95bee7c0569baff37d906f144c19.webm?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/698c95bee7c0569baff37d906f144c19.mp4?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Neo-Tokyo\u2019s intense world of motorcycle racing. Clear levels at neck-breaking speeds and avoid hitting innocent commuters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After totaling your bike in a race, you stumble upon a demon-possessed engine in a junkyard that offers speeds and power you can\u2019t refuse. Battle for freedom from possession and overcome the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/637bd53e39a7a4cc791faa04983f4e3a.poster.avif?t=1772810197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/637bd53e39a7a4cc791faa04983f4e3a.webm?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/637bd53e39a7a4cc791faa04983f4e3a.mp4?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the thrilling elements of a 3D runner, maneuver through fast-paced levels by performing wheelies, ducking, sliding, and jumping. Racers can also increase their maneuverability by adjusting their speed, accelerating and decelerating depending on the environment they face.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop wheelies while accelerating to great speeds as you lane split and duck for precision steering. Avoid decapitation in rapidly changing track environments by sliding across asphalt while avoiding numerous barriers. Keep the adrenaline pumping as you launch yourself on ramps and weave through congested Tokyo streets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/024d2e61732e768fadf9feef98468ff5.poster.avif?t=1772810197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/024d2e61732e768fadf9feef98468ff5.webm?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/024d2e61732e768fadf9feef98468ff5.mp4?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Demonic Symbols scattered throughout 45 levels, including unlockables that can only be accessed by completing skill objectives in each level.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level contains three skill objectives:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing at a record-breaking time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero demolition, avoid colliding with high-speed traffic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near misses: drive close enough to kiss cars without colliding\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonic Symbols claimed unlock chapters of manga, progressing you deeper into the unfolding story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/dfa63ed6219d9165da4a19d6c8de19d7.poster.avif?t=1772810197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/dfa63ed6219d9165da4a19d6c8de19d7.webm?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/dfa63ed6219d9165da4a19d6c8de19d7.mp4?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re thrown into a vibrant, futuristic Tokyo, packed with stunning visuals and expertly crafted tracks that push your limits with each new level unlocked.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone offers its own vibe. Drift through power plants, duck into collapsing tunnels as you test your skill, and break through windows as you shred through a neon-drenched shopping mall. Every environment is fast and unforgiving.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty increases as you progress through levels. Later levels will push your skills to the edge. Hidden collectibles can be found throughout levels, easy to spot early on, but harder to find as you advance. Master the toughest paths to claim them all and keep the adrenaline pumping.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2990060?t=1772810197","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772810197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772810197","capsule_ima