ghout 45 levels, including unlockables that can only be accessed by completing skill objectives in each level.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level contains three skill objectives:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing at a record-breaking time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero demolition, avoid colliding with high-speed traffic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near misses: drive close enough to kiss cars without colliding\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonic Symbols claimed unlock chapters of manga, progressing you deeper into the unfolding story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/dfa63ed6219d9165da4a19d6c8de19d7.poster.avif?t=1772810197\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/dfa63ed6219d9165da4a19d6c8de19d7.webm?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/extras/dfa63ed6219d9165da4a19d6c8de19d7.mp4?t=1772810197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re thrown into a vibrant, futuristic Tokyo, packed with stunning visuals and expertly crafted tracks that push your limits with each new level unlocked.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone offers its own vibe. Drift through power plants, duck into collapsing tunnels as you test your skill, and break through windows as you shred through a neon-drenched shopping mall. Every environment is fast and unforgiving.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty increases as you progress through levels. Later levels will push your skills to the edge. Hidden collectibles can be found throughout levels, easy to spot early on, but harder to find as you advance. Master the toughest paths to claim them all and keep the adrenaline pumping.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Baltoro Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990060/header.jpg?t=1772810197","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2990060/350960933/b6c89c69ad5d5381ba1e5458bb009c5e7e904d6e/1767868547/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767871438","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2990060/350960933/b6c89c69ad5d5381ba1e5458bb009c5e7e904d6e/1767868547/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767871438","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2990060/350960933/b6c89c69ad5d5381ba1e5458bb009c5e7e904d6e/1767868547/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767871438","id":257261572,"name":"Moto Rush Reborn - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257261572/3fbf21efe0b291b3ea1646e88a35c5b690082ea8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767871438"}],"name":"Moto Rush Reborn","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Duo or faster<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 compliant video card<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</